{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1766187,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"pink_un","paid":0,"title":"Pixel Persona","festival_id":null,"organization_id":129,"web_url":"bbdu.ac.in\/","start_date":"2026-10-05T19:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-09T16:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/pixel-persona-babu-banarasi-das-university-bbdu-lucknow-1766187","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>A Digital Fine-Art &amp; Frontend Creativity Challenge<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"314\">\n<li data-section-id=\"q70jnb\" data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"136\"><strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"93\">Organised by:<\/strong> Alankaar &mdash; Fine Arts Forum, BBD University<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1asebuj\" data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"163\"><strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"148\">Date:<\/strong> 9 October 2026<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qvgrn8\" data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"200\"><strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"176\">Venue:<\/strong> BBD University, Lucknow<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjaeod\" data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"226\"><strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"216\">Duration:<\/strong> 6&ndash;7 Hours<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l5dqwm\" data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"260\"><strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"243\">Team Size:<\/strong> 1&ndash;2 Participants<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctww88\" data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"314\"><strong data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"274\">Format:<\/strong> Single-Round On-Spot Creative Challenge<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>About the Event<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"353\">Pixel Persona<\/strong> is an interdisciplinary creative challenge that brings together <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"500\">Fine Arts, Digital Design, UI\/UX, Visual Storytelling and Frontend Development<\/strong>.<br \/><br \/><\/p>\n<p>Participants will be given a <strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"575\">theme and problem statement on the spot<\/strong> and will have to transform their interpretation into an engaging digital experience using their creativity, design thinking and frontend skills.<\/p>\n<p>This is not just about writing code &mdash; it is about <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"846\">how you think, how you create and how you tell a story through pixels.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Theme &mdash; Beyond the Frame<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants will explore the idea of going beyond conventional boundaries &mdash; physical, emotional, cultural, psychological, technological or imaginative.<\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1053\">Problem Statement:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1220\">\"The world we experience is often limited by the frames we create. Break one such frame and express what lies beyond it through an interactive digital experience.\"<\/em><\/p>\n<p>There is <strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1267\">no single correct interpretation<\/strong>. Your concept, artistic direction and originality define your creation.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event flow<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1539\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1tcwdet\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1381\">Registration &amp; Briefing<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5jj64s\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1424\">On-Spot Theme &amp; Problem Statement Reveal<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pqfsq0\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1457\">Ideation &amp; Concept Development<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j8l9q9\" data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1489\">Design &amp; Frontend Development<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2grlt8\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1508\">Final Submission<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jkriqj\" data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1539\">Jury Showcase &amp; Presentation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1762\">\n<li data-section-id=\"c933y3\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1598\">Creativity &amp; Originality &mdash; 30%<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pgtfv1\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1644\">Art Direction &amp; Visual Aesthetics &mdash; 25%<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gn19h6\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1688\">Conceptual Depth &amp; Storytelling &mdash; 20%<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"n1oklq\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1730\">Interaction &amp; User Experience &mdash; 15%<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqr8wp\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1762\">Technical Execution &mdash; 10%<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Participation Guidelines<br \/>join the group : <a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/JZC8llbtxddIF3PtfpRonh\">https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/JZC8llbtxddIF3PtfpRonh<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"2251\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgftme\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1826\">Team size: <strong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1826\">1&ndash;2 participants<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9fnc8\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1853\">Single-round competition<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"whre3s\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1894\">Theme will be revealed <strong data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1894\">on the spot<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xo39nm\" data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1954\">Final work must be substantially created during the event<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2bfb9h\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2018\">Originality and creative interpretation are highly encouraged<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3ksdk\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2096\">Pre-built templates or direct copying of existing designs are not permitted<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rk4c90\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2188\">Participants may use permitted frontend technologies, design tools and external libraries<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"x1vwk7\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2251\">Each team will present and explain their concept to the jury<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Will recieve goodies and awards ","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"re